able-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p><italic>PCLO</italic> replication results.</p></caption><table><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><graphic xlink:href="nihms75279t4"/></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>Abbreviations: N=total sample size for an analysis, Z=logistic regression beta divided by its standard error, P=asymptotic p-value from Wald chi-square test (1 df) uncorrected for multiple comparisons, P_corr=empirical p-value from accounting for multiple comparisons and LD structure (50K permutations), and I^2=i-squared, an index of heterogeneity of logistic regression parameter estimates.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>